4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S2bEObqCzhkQ7kNvwFDPNWp&_nc_oc=AdpPkbq_UO5pqr1XmaJmFzVQlaDOqdJXjfH9qWwoXSSzygFMLlRK5X1vfpGuhhZaDHA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJqFK7Y8DN4M-NPEq7mXEhgAgMsfzsBr_Bx8t28-dmq5A&oe=6AB51FD4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s2kCXst_xTEQ7kNvwGqTXVA&_nc_oc=AdooLm_OjGk862G1Pi12A_IlioEB93Muy3zm9V3cG0ZIL2xdCEJXXem2vE3UZi0JS9I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJKKqfUSo4hg-kROAZBQr3USVYddxathJQvBfWZrn0IAA&oe=6AB524B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2lkclVvLGOIQ7kNvwGyAtJ0&_nc_oc=AdrsjXgO0-y-Y59aPVRG9vl-80rgEJVnenj4sItOCs5dSvkJMfWxkPA8vxugS6-W20U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKGt5t6D-JqVhfJk08HXjL_r--0U7PvuffeVULsTk1m-w&oe=6AB53255"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p